<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call warrants on Cathay.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call warrants on Cathay.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it has launched 250 million call warrants on shares of Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.80     PREMIUM	    10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.390     GEARING	    4.1x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  29.JUN.98    LISTING DATE     17.JUL.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$16.05     SETTLEMENT DATE  14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
